# 10. CITY REVIEW COMPLETION

This requires source verification.

Review completion and criterion eligibility are different dimensions.

### Example

- Five criteria reviewed.
- Four criteria passed.
- One criterion failed.

The City review may be fully assessed, but its eligibility result remains negative.

Do not leave completed-but-failing dossiers permanently stuck in "Đang xét".

### Explicit completion

Inspect whether the backend has a legitimate authorized City review completion operation.

If completion is a separate human attestation, retain it.

Simplify its UI:

"Hoàn tất thẩm định"

Place it at the end of the appropriate dossier context.

Do not require duplicate completion at every criterion if those steps are merely derived.

### Safety

Do not auto-attest City completion based solely on five passing criteria.

Do not auto-forward to Committee based solely on computed eligibility.

Use the actual domain contract.

On API failure:

- Show an accurate error.
- Do not claim completion.
- Preserve reviewer context.
- Handle concurrent changes safely.

